Subject: dt-bindings: power: supply: describe the Piano charge stages

Describe the SC8541 main charging stage and SC96231 pen transmitter.

The port retains changes from these linux-piano commits:
piano: SC8541 switched-capacitor stage and direct charging (#27) (bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com>)

The cited SunUEFI changes were carried through the 7.3 port.

